WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.337 --> 00:00:07.407
[Subtitles by danielsangeo]

00:00:09.576 --> 00:00:11.311
[gagging]

00:00:11.311 --> 00:00:13.046
ELI: He didn't come through!

00:00:13.046 --> 00:00:14.681
KLEINER: Where is he?!

00:00:14.681 --> 00:00:15.182
ELI: Behind you.

00:00:15.182 --> 00:00:16.083
KLEINER!

00:00:16.083 --> 00:00:16.817
[Kleiner screams]

00:00:16.817 --> 00:00:17.818
ELI: Shut it down! Shut it down!

00:00:17.818 --> 00:00:18.952
SHUT IT DOWN!
ELI: Shut it down! Shut it down!

00:00:18.952 --> 00:00:21.154
KLEINER: Gordon, you must
get out of here! Run!

00:00:21.154 --> 00:00:22.990
I CAN'T MOVE!

00:00:22.990 --> 00:00:26.226
KLEINER, WHY?! WHY ARE YOU DOING THIS?!

00:00:26.226 --> 00:00:27.961
OH! Oh!

00:00:27.961 --> 00:00:30.063
Oh God, paparazzi.

00:00:30.063 --> 00:00:31.131
No!

00:00:31.131 --> 00:00:32.566
NO PHOTOS!

00:00:32.566 --> 00:00:33.834
I'M A VICTIM!

00:00:33.834 --> 00:00:37.204
I DON'T WANT THIS IN THE NEWS!
THIS IS BETWEEN ME AND KLEINER!

00:00:37.204 --> 00:00:40.007
WE HAVE A LOT TO DISCUSS!
YOU'RE NOT A PART OF IT!

00:00:40.007 --> 00:00:41.475
Are they following me?

00:00:41.475 --> 00:00:43.977
Oh, God! I'm still shaking!

00:00:43.977 --> 00:00:46.380
I'm still not convinced
that the field is fully off

00:00:46.380 --> 00:00:48.815
and I won't just get ripped away any second.

00:00:51.118 --> 00:00:55.289
So what now? I guess I should get breakfast?

00:00:55.289 --> 00:00:55.789
BARNEY: Hey, Gordon!

00:00:55.789 --> 00:00:56.623
DAH!

00:00:56.623 --> 00:00:58.625
I'M DONE! NOT AGAIN!

00:00:58.625 --> 00:01:00.761
BARNEY: The Citadel's on full alert--I've
never seen it lit up like that!

00:01:00.761 --> 00:01:01.228
What?

00:01:01.228 --> 00:01:04.064
BARNEY: Get out of City 17
as fast as you can, Gordon.

00:01:04.064 --> 00:01:05.499
BARNEY: Take the old canals, right?

00:01:05.499 --> 00:01:07.067
I don't know where anything is.

00:01:07.067 --> 00:01:07.968
BARNEY: It's a dangerous route,

00:01:07.968 --> 00:01:11.838
BARNEY: but there's a whole network of
refugees and they'll help you if they can.

00:01:11.838 --> 00:01:14.207
BARNEY: I'd come with you, but
I gotta look after Dr. Kleiner.

00:01:14.207 --> 00:01:15.809
He can look after himself!

00:01:15.809 --> 00:01:19.513
BARNEY: Before I forget, I think
you dropped this back in Black Mesa.

00:01:19.513 --> 00:01:20.514
What?

00:01:20.514 --> 00:01:21.648
BARNEY: Good luck out there, buddy.

00:01:21.648 --> 00:01:22.149
Hey!

00:01:22.149 --> 00:01:22.816
BARNEY: You're gonna need it.

00:01:22.816 --> 00:01:27.588
No, hey! Stop goofing around! I
need a gun! I know you have one!

00:01:27.588 --> 00:01:29.122
And some cash!

00:01:29.122 --> 00:01:31.892
Are you going to make me come up there?

00:01:31.892 --> 00:01:33.994
This is such a clown show.

00:01:33.994 --> 00:01:37.464
Well, I guess I believe him when he
says I should get out of the city.

00:01:37.464 --> 00:01:40.133
Why did he hand me a crowbar? That's weird.

00:01:40.133 --> 00:01:42.536
How about a map or a phone number?

00:01:42.536 --> 00:01:45.272
[grunting]
GUESS I'LL USE IT SINCE I HAVE IT!

00:01:45.272 --> 00:01:47.074
I could've climbed this.

00:01:47.074 --> 00:01:50.077
Dammit, you know what the
problem is? I just got Kleinered.

00:01:50.077 --> 00:01:53.780
I have a hundred questions I
need answered, I need supplies,

00:01:53.780 --> 00:01:57.284
but instead he distracted me, got
me excited about his experiment,

00:01:57.284 --> 00:01:59.586
then almost got me killed--again--

00:01:59.586 --> 00:02:01.955
and now the experiment's
done, I'm out the door.

00:02:01.955 --> 00:02:03.056
Dammit, Kleiner!

00:02:03.056 --> 00:02:04.157
Oh--OH!

00:02:04.157 --> 00:02:05.592
NO! NOT AGAIN!

00:02:05.592 --> 00:02:06.093
HAH!

00:02:06.093 --> 00:02:07.394
[muttering]

00:02:07.394 --> 00:02:08.795
BLAH!

00:02:08.795 --> 00:02:09.763
FUCK YOU!

00:02:09.763 --> 00:02:12.699
Okay, I guess that IS a
good use for the crowbar.

00:02:12.699 --> 00:02:15.302
Like a giant robot mosquito.

00:02:15.302 --> 00:02:16.203
See, I'm adapting.

00:02:16.203 --> 00:02:16.770
[gunshots]

00:02:16.770 --> 00:02:18.372
HOLY SHIT!

00:02:18.372 --> 00:02:20.407
This is bad, bad, BAD!

00:02:20.407 --> 00:02:23.176
That is the one advantage
I had and now it's gone!

00:02:23.176 --> 00:02:24.311
DAH!

00:02:24.311 --> 00:02:26.480
[grunting]

00:02:26.480 --> 00:02:28.415
What do I do? What do I do?!

00:02:28.415 --> 00:02:29.182
Uh!

00:02:29.182 --> 00:02:31.318
I'll run! Yeah, they'll never think of that!

00:02:31.985 --> 00:02:32.552
[train whistle]

00:02:32.552 --> 00:02:33.620
Huh?
[train whistle]

00:02:33.620 --> 00:02:35.555
Oh, God, God, GOD!

00:02:35.555 --> 00:02:37.991
WHY ARE THERE SO MANY COPS IN A RAILYARD?!

00:02:37.991 --> 00:02:39.893
This has gotta be a fascist state.

00:02:39.893 --> 00:02:42.729
How does that go? Mussolini
made the trains run on time?

00:02:42.729 --> 00:02:45.332
AH! NO! HOW DO YOU HAVE A LINE OF SIGHT?!

00:02:46.133 --> 00:02:46.967
Oof!

00:02:46.967 --> 00:02:48.035
JESUS!

00:02:48.035 --> 00:02:50.137
Do they get a bonus if they hit me?!

00:02:51.338 --> 00:02:53.173
Are they climbing the fence?

00:02:53.173 --> 00:02:54.408
Good. They're lazy.

00:02:54.408 --> 00:02:56.276
Yeah, I guess the trains WOULD run on time

00:02:56.276 --> 00:03:00.047
if you have 20 fucking cops
waiting to blow your head off!

00:03:00.047 --> 00:03:01.682
Maybe they think I'm a conductor.

00:03:02.449 --> 00:03:05.085
[yelling]

00:03:05.085 --> 00:03:08.789
Oh! Sweet concrete! I never
thought I'd miss you so!

00:03:08.789 --> 00:03:11.124
Okay! Time for our morning jog!

00:03:11.124 --> 00:03:11.725
WOMAN: Please! Stop!

00:03:11.725 --> 00:03:12.526
Nope!
WOMAN: Please! Stop!

00:03:12.526 --> 00:03:14.094
This is a problem!

00:03:14.094 --> 00:03:17.197
I guess my only play is
to be cool and walk by.

00:03:17.197 --> 00:03:21.334
"Hi, officer. I'm just a goon in
body armor holding a fucking crowbar.

00:03:21.334 --> 00:03:22.903
"Nothing suspicious here."

00:03:22.903 --> 00:03:24.271
AH!

00:03:24.271 --> 00:03:25.706
STOP THAT!

00:03:25.706 --> 00:03:28.008
OKAY, YOU'RE PLAYING FAIR! EN GARDE!

00:03:28.942 --> 00:03:30.143
GUN! YES!

00:03:30.143 --> 00:03:31.878
WOMAN: They're going to
be looking for you, now.

00:03:31.878 --> 00:03:33.947
WOMAN: You'd better run. There's
nothing else you can do here.

00:03:33.947 --> 00:03:35.649
THEY'RE ALREADY LOOKING FOR ME!

00:03:35.649 --> 00:03:38.218
WHAT THE HELL DO YOU THINK
I'M DOING, TRYING TO RUN?!

00:03:38.218 --> 00:03:39.419
No, I just woke up today

00:03:39.419 --> 00:03:42.756
and decided to bash some cops'
heads in for no reason, y'know?

00:03:42.756 --> 00:03:43.824
Oh no.

00:03:43.824 --> 00:03:44.324
DROP IT!

00:03:46.159 --> 00:03:48.028
FINE! DO IT THE HARD WAY!

00:03:48.028 --> 00:03:53.133
Crossing lines here... Gunning down cops.
Now I'm no better than what's-her-face.

00:03:53.133 --> 00:03:54.901
And she's the reason they're after me!

00:03:54.901 --> 00:03:55.769
I swear to--

00:03:55.769 --> 00:03:56.103
[gunshot]

00:03:56.103 --> 00:03:57.037
AH!

00:03:59.439 --> 00:04:03.143
Yeah! Why not?! I'm in this deep;
might as well keep shooting.

00:04:03.143 --> 00:04:03.910
See, that's the--

00:04:03.910 --> 00:04:04.511
[chopper]

00:04:04.511 --> 00:04:05.011
Ah!

00:04:07.247 --> 00:04:09.349
Oh wait. Pigeons aren't cops.

00:04:09.349 --> 00:04:12.285
That's just a comic book, or... something...

00:04:12.285 --> 00:04:16.223
Okay, things look kind of quiet.
Maybe I'm finally a step ahead now.

00:04:16.223 --> 00:04:18.625
Though that railyard
looked pretty quiet, too.

00:04:18.625 --> 00:04:21.094
God, they were right on top of me!

00:04:21.094 --> 00:04:23.063
Did that Barney guy tip them off?

00:04:23.063 --> 00:04:24.631
Wait, am I just a decoy?

00:04:24.631 --> 00:04:26.066
[train whistle]

00:04:26.066 --> 00:04:27.400
Yeah, I see you.

00:04:27.400 --> 00:04:31.605
Why did Kleiner make me wear this suit if
he sent what's-her-face in just her clothes?

00:04:31.605 --> 00:04:34.875
I still don't have a helmet so it
wouldn't have saved me from an overload.

00:04:34.875 --> 00:04:38.445
Are they just using me as a
diversion to draw fire off them?

00:04:38.445 --> 00:04:42.716
Ah, I've gotta get out of here, though.
The cops are not THAT far behind.

00:04:42.716 --> 00:04:46.153
As soon as they figure out how to
climb a fence, I've got problems.

00:04:46.153 --> 00:04:48.722
Eh, this train's going too fast.

00:04:48.722 --> 00:04:49.723
Maybe...

00:04:49.723 --> 00:04:52.259
Oh, it's slowing down!
Maybe I could freight hop.

00:04:52.259 --> 00:04:54.027
Shit, it's stopping.

00:04:54.027 --> 00:04:55.262
That was quick.

00:04:55.262 --> 00:04:57.430
Oh, you know what? We're
going to make this work.

00:04:59.166 --> 00:05:00.467
Yeah!

00:05:00.467 --> 00:05:03.170
Playing Frogger will save your life!

00:05:03.170 --> 00:05:04.137
Especially if you're...

00:05:04.938 --> 00:05:06.540
...a cop-killer.

00:05:06.540 --> 00:05:07.207
So, I still need to--

00:05:07.207 --> 00:05:07.808
[gunshots]

00:05:07.808 --> 00:05:09.376
OH, THEY'RE HERE!

00:05:09.376 --> 00:05:11.077
[gunshots]
JEEZ! THAT WAS CLOSE TO MY HEAD!

00:05:11.077 --> 00:05:13.146
WHAT THE HELL YOU DOING?!

00:05:13.146 --> 00:05:16.550
Oh, that is bad! BAD BAD BAD!

00:05:16.550 --> 00:05:18.718
YEAH! SHOOT UP A FLARE
SHOWING EVERYONE WHERE I AM

00:05:18.718 --> 00:05:21.054
JUST IN CASE RADIO'S NOT ENOUGH!

00:05:21.054 --> 00:05:23.657
Oh my God! It's a box of bullets!

00:05:23.657 --> 00:05:25.759
The gods are watching!

00:05:27.494 --> 00:05:29.429
But not you!

00:05:29.429 --> 00:05:31.565
This society is so strange.

00:05:31.565 --> 00:05:35.635
I can't imagine a box of bullets left at a
construction site and no one taking them.

00:05:35.635 --> 00:05:37.404
They're the right caliber, too!

00:05:37.404 --> 00:05:38.338
Yah!

00:05:38.338 --> 00:05:39.973
Don't panic. Keep moving.

00:05:39.973 --> 00:05:40.840
[gunshots]
Fuck...

00:05:40.840 --> 00:05:44.544
These Charles Bronson motherfuckers
aren't giving up, are they?

00:05:44.544 --> 00:05:48.048
Fine! I don't know what country this
is, but I can speak their language!

00:05:48.048 --> 00:05:49.683
Complete sentences, too!

00:05:52.586 --> 00:05:56.389
Yeah, they must've found a stepladder
or something to get over that fence.

00:05:56.389 --> 00:05:58.491
[straining]

00:05:58.491 --> 00:06:00.994
They really are some
trigger-happy fucks, though.

00:06:00.994 --> 00:06:03.797
I never once heard a "freeze"
or anything in Russian.

00:06:03.797 --> 00:06:06.132
[gunshots]
SPEAK OF THE DEVIL!

00:06:06.132 --> 00:06:07.567
BLAH!

00:06:07.567 --> 00:06:08.501
SPIES!

00:06:09.436 --> 00:06:10.670
Stupid flare...

00:06:12.339 --> 00:06:14.341
They saw me before I saw them!

00:06:14.341 --> 00:06:18.411
Why is this stupid suit orange?!
It should've been urban camo.

00:06:18.411 --> 00:06:21.181
WHAT WAS THE PLAN,
KLEINER?! WHAT WAS THE PLAN?

00:06:21.181 --> 00:06:25.919
More bullets! Is this on purpose? Is
this some sort of predetermination?

00:06:25.919 --> 00:06:26.653
[gunshot]
Ah!

00:06:26.653 --> 00:06:28.255
They don't even wait to aim!

00:06:29.422 --> 00:06:30.590
You just fire!

00:06:31.558 --> 00:06:33.727
You see something moving, you fire!

00:06:33.727 --> 00:06:34.928
Fucking cops...

00:06:34.928 --> 00:06:37.330
There's too many... let's go!

00:06:37.330 --> 00:06:38.164
Oh, a vent!

00:06:38.798 --> 00:06:41.334
This is some sort of smuggling operation.

00:06:42.736 --> 00:06:43.770
More bullets!

00:06:44.904 --> 00:06:47.173
What the hell kind of vent is this?!

00:06:47.173 --> 00:06:48.808
IT'S NOT VENTING ANYTHING!

00:06:48.808 --> 00:06:50.443
YOU'RE SUPPOSED TO LEAD ME TO SOME WAREHOUSE

00:06:50.443 --> 00:06:53.813
WHERE I CAN SNEAK OUT THE OTHER
SIDE, NOT BACK INTO THE FIRE!

00:06:55.715 --> 00:06:58.685
Fucking Christ! There's no end to them!

00:06:58.685 --> 00:06:59.953
RAAAH!

00:06:59.953 --> 00:07:02.355
Well, that's it! I'm fucked!

00:07:02.355 --> 00:07:03.623
Are they retreating?

00:07:03.623 --> 00:07:05.558
[gunshot]
No options!

00:07:05.558 --> 00:07:06.693
Aaaah!

00:07:07.861 --> 00:07:10.063
CAN'T YOU SEE I'M IN PAIN?!

00:07:10.063 --> 00:07:11.298
WHAT THE FUCK?!

00:07:11.298 --> 00:07:12.032
[siren wailing]

00:07:12.032 --> 00:07:13.099
[siren wailing, explosion]

00:07:13.099 --> 00:07:15.936
[siren wailing, bell ringing]
WAAAAAAAH! WAAAAAAAAAAAAAH!

00:07:15.936 --> 00:07:16.903
[bell ringing]
WHAT'S HAPPENING?!

00:07:17.904 --> 00:07:20.507
Did they just pour burning oil on me?!

00:07:20.507 --> 00:07:22.275
Is this is the Middle Ages?!

00:07:22.275 --> 00:07:23.610
Is this a siege?!

00:07:25.278 --> 00:07:26.413
Go away!

00:07:27.814 --> 00:07:30.383
Do they think I'm trying
to siege the rail line?!

00:07:30.383 --> 00:07:32.385
Is that why they're fighting to the death?!

00:07:32.385 --> 00:07:34.954
They think I'm trying to
conquer their homelands?!

00:07:34.954 --> 00:07:37.090
This is different than fighting soldiers.

00:07:37.090 --> 00:07:37.691
[gunshot]

00:07:37.691 --> 00:07:39.025
Ahh!

00:07:39.025 --> 00:07:43.029
With soldiers, I was one enemy
among many. Here, I'm all they have.

00:07:43.930 --> 00:07:47.033
I can't get a shot... Okay, run then?

00:07:47.033 --> 00:07:51.371
That seems to be the answer to everything:
run and shoot people, and... run...

00:07:51.371 --> 00:07:53.807
and... run...

00:07:53.807 --> 00:07:54.741
Oh! Maintenance door!

00:07:54.741 --> 00:07:56.876
Be open! Be open!

00:07:56.876 --> 00:07:58.311
NO-HO-HO!

00:07:59.713 --> 00:08:01.014
[chopper]
Oh! A helicopter!

00:08:01.014 --> 00:08:03.249
That's... that's wonderful.

00:08:03.249 --> 00:08:05.185
RAAAAAAAAAAH!

00:08:10.190 --> 00:08:12.559
I'm not getting breakfast
this morning, am I?

